power: supply: UMP9620 retained SOC and full qualification follow stock

Actual connected U30 Air vendor sc27xx_fuel_gauge.ko decodes percent in
bits 7:0 and tenths in bits 11:8 (probe 0x1bd0), and saves via masked RMW
with 200 us waits (save_last_cap 0x4ba4). Drop the ambiguous-value/50 mA
migration heuristic; do not overwrite a valid stock-format retained value.
Keep shutdown sampling. Replace the invented 70-percent OCV full threshold
with the original battery-node full voltage/current thresholds, requiring
a real charger Full indication as before. Do not change charger limits.

